{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_966.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"13091f120533cee726c8ee8117c5b6e45cad01ad04577a97e431f72fafd6369e","ja":"ふぅ、これでベルは全部外れましたわね……。\n真、そちらはどうです？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_966.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"ff1caf2e0e408635100915ad2bd3a94483d6e284801cee7d63d9b37952b28898","ja":"それが、綿が枝に絡まっちゃって、なかなか……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_966.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"6c5c5415453a7a1027c2c16b4dafd8065368f1d4c87258ea414b0a9b071cc1d7","ja":"……っと。よし、取れました！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_966.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a1a36b83f956a5e047c34a9e05158e1fa0fbf7747d9388a4b48bdcc97c12a719","ja":"早いものですよね。クリスマスツリー、\nこの前、飾ったばっかりなのに。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_966.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"35274f295f20e3ea862ef67f24f6d603f34709711dbc19a56ebe23ef67a6f6b1","ja":"ええ、この時期は1年で1番\nあっという間に過ぎてしまうかもしれませんわね。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_966.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"7c3d614f5b3a12bd7909e14cd693add4976e9a97cb9207fca250902c678fde4c","ja":"そうですよね……世間はもうすっかり年末ムードで\nなんだか目まぐるしいです。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_966.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"836f8baf7c5869c45ceb6484371a8efcce1c6e41137d2464a65cc881f39403d6","ja":"ふふ、お坊さんも走り出すほど忙しい『師走』\n……ですものね♪","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_966.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"4c7ba9fc7f9cdb4940c67386b862b9975cdf55e24a945900d4216a98926874ab","ja":"『師』ってお坊さんのことだったんですか！\n確かに、お坊さんが走ってるところ見たことないです。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_966.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"7a207c6fa0edc7947c0de98188fc21fed0031242ef113e11d241769413aa4b13","ja":"でも、千鶴さんは師走でも走ったりしなさそう\nですよね。いつだって優雅ですから。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_966.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"becf68e4b7bb63840126e5317de4d7acc83aed5a9a4134d608ebf6303282fab0","ja":"あら、わたくしも今は勝負の時期ですわ。\n年末年始のセールでは……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_966.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"4714a8a2bc46f175e7aa91b6dccdba0761414acf83b430dfe0ed054816901d7f","ja":"え？　セール……ですか？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_966.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"4196a4a6b6948c9db6152331f87d4c59b684943f86bb869220bc582fb8c061d6","ja":"はっ！　せ、セーヌ川のほとりを走ったりしますの。\n今、セレブで人気のスポットですのよ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_966.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"afa655c2b18256d16a8359208378dcfff6639b8487d15e08b575db31cbbc4c3a","ja":"わあ。年末年始は海外で過ごすんですね！\nさすがだな～千鶴さん。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_966.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"2c84848ffa807cdd906efbda6c04d1fa6ad825ed3d14d0de191a8b691054e367","ja":"え、ええ……！　さ、まだまだ終わりじゃ\nありませんわよ。ツリー以外も片付けましょう。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_966.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"d0e58e33d43ca50edd19384086d84e353f2bc572aa4fc59b16b0fa51b785fad0","ja":"はい！　えーっと、他には～……あ！　リース……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_966.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"3da53295e8f1b398554fbe8088802add50e1633ed1b8db9917257f720ba32754","ja":"これも片付けないと、ですね……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_966.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"150723e4f1b754ec0af742252563d332051b5a003066e07146d1c13732f79841","ja":"そうですわね、ちょっと残念ですけど……。\n仕事の合間に、みんなで丁寧に手作りしましたから。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_966.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"287e249b90850046cf655b3da7ce396233649e29e7c758124d4df5afb4b9d5d5","ja":"はい。千鶴さんが色々と教えてくれて。\nすっごく楽しかったな～……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
